<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market not tested-USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market not tested-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was slow in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry from buyers. 1,100 head confirmed for the week to date.</p>
<p>The last established price was 63.00 on Friday. Monday's packer bids are 62.00 with asking prices mostly 64.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Note - all cattle prices based on net weights FOB the feedlot after a 4 percent shrink.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
